        "instruction": {
          "title": "Antiparallel strand orientation",
          "description": "Examine the two strands and identify their opposite directions. One backbone runs 5' to 3' while the complementary strand runs 3' to 5'. Observe how this antiparallel arrangement follows from the directionality of the sugar-phosphate backbone."
        },
